SUMMARY:Oakdale Loop w/ Lou Nocito ~4 miles
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\nSunday\, N
 ovember 29\, 10:00 – 12:00: Oakdale Loop.\n\nA post-Thanksgiving traditi
 on\, this 2-3 mile hike **MAY** help get rid of some of that extra pie.\n\
 nMeet at: Oakdale parking area on Cherry Lane right across the road from t
 he reservoir.\n\nLeader: Lou Nocito\, 973-953-7099\n\n\\*\\*\\* In registe
 ring for this or any other South Mountain Conservancy (SMC) programs in 20
 26 online\, I hereby release and agree to hold the SMC\, its volunteers\, 
